    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12354764/comment/12454308",
          "id": "12454308",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=gsingers",
            "name": "gsingers",
            "key": "gsingers",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Grant Ingersoll",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "I am working on the nightly build stuff, etc.  My plan is to start hosting versions under the \"Site Versions\" section.  I originally planned for Official and Nightly, but Chris and Doron have suggested other versions as well.  I see no reason why we can't have other versions similar to the way other projects do it in Apache-land.\n\nI see two issues that have been discussed and would like some feedback on.\n\n1.  Make the official website be the nightly build website.  The only issue I have w/ this is that it is possible for the nightly build to fail, which could leave the site stale.  Not a big deal as it isn't likely to be radically different, just something to be aware of.\n\n2.  I would suggest the following links under Site Versions:\nOfficial \n2.0\n1.9.1\n1.9\n1.4.3\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=gsingers",
            "name": "gsingers",
            "key": "gsingers",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Grant Ingersoll",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2006-11-29T13:51:14.000+0000",
          "updated": "2006-11-29T13:51:14.000+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12354764/comment/12454375",
          "id": "12454375",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=doronc",
            "name": "doronc",
            "key": "doronc",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738"
            },
            "displayName": "Doron Cohen",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Gaza"
          },
          "body": "Could \"official\" be the most recent release (currently 2.0)? \n\nSo there would be:\n Official (2.0)\n Nightly\n 1.9.1\n 1.9\n 1.4.3\n\nThis way everyday users would not have to get into trunk_/_svn details for understanding what docs they are seeing. \n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=doronc",
            "name": "doronc",
            "key": "doronc",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738"
            },
            "displayName": "Doron Cohen",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Gaza"
          },
          "created": "2006-11-29T17:09:50.000+0000",
          "updated": "2006-11-29T17:09:50.000+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12354764/comment/12454427",
          "id": "12454427",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=cutting",
            "name": "cutting",
            "key": "cutting",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Doug Cutting",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles"
          },
          "body": "According to Apache policy, nightly builds must not be easily confused with releases.\n\nhttp://www.apache.org/dev/release.html#what\n\nThus links to nightly builds should be confined to 'developer' portions of the site, and not included on 'download' pages.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=cutting",
            "name": "cutting",
            "key": "cutting",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Doug Cutting",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles"
          },
          "created": "2006-11-29T20:13:00.000+0000",
          "updated": "2006-11-29T20:13:00.000+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12354764/comment/12454453",
          "id": "12454453",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=gsingers",
            "name": "gsingers",
            "key": "gsingers",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Grant Ingersoll",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Doug,\n\nHow about I take the nightly build and source download off of http://lucene.apache.org/java/docs/releases.html and create a Developers section with a page full of links of developer's resources: the nightly build, the source download instructions, how to contribute, etc.\n\n-Grant",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=gsingers",
            "name": "gsingers",
            "key": "gsingers",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
